flowchart TB
    %% Styling - Using color-palette-dark.css
    classDef inputClass fill:#4A90E2,stroke:#2E5C8A,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef processClass fill:#50C878,stroke:#3A9B5C,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef agentClass fill:#7B68EE,stroke:#5A4DB3,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef llmClass fill:#9C88B5,stroke:#7A6A92,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef decisionClass fill:#FFC107,stroke:#E0A800,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    classDef outputClass fill:#DC3545,stroke:#BD2130,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef dbClass fill:#20C997,stroke:#17A673,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff

    %% Start
    Start([Claim Submitted with Images]):::inputClass

    %% Initialize Supervisor
    Start --> InitSupervisor[Initialize Fraud Detection Supervisor<br/>AI AGENTS FIRST STRATEGY]:::agentClass

    %% PHASE 1: AI VISION AGENTS (SHOWCASE AI VALUE!)
    InitSupervisor --> Phase1[PHASE 1: AI VISION AGENTS<br/>Run in Parallel - SHOWCASE AI!]:::llmClass

    Phase1 --> VisionAgent1[Color Verification Agent<br/>Vision LLM analyzes images]:::llmClass
    Phase1 --> VisionAgent2[Make/Model Verification Agent<br/>Vision LLM identifies vehicle]:::llmClass
    Phase1 --> VisionAgent3[AI-Generated Image Detector<br/>Vision LLM detects deepfakes]:::llmClass
    Phase1 --> VisionAgent4[Image Manipulation Detector<br/>EXIF + Vision LLM]:::llmClass

    VisionAgent1 --> Check1[Does vehicle COLOR in images<br/>match policy records?]:::agentClass
    VisionAgent2 --> Check2[Does vehicle MAKE/MODEL in images<br/>match policy records?]:::agentClass
    VisionAgent3 --> Check3[Are damage images<br/>AI-generated synthetic?]:::agentClass
    VisionAgent4 --> Check4[Are images edited with<br/>Photoshop or manipulation tools?]:::agentClass

    Check1 --> AggregateVision[Aggregate AI Vision Signals]:::agentClass
    Check2 --> AggregateVision
    Check3 --> AggregateVision
    Check4 --> AggregateVision

    AggregateVision --> CalcVisionRisk[Calculate Vision Risk Score]:::processClass

    %% PHASE 2: STATIC VALIDATION (Backup layer)
    CalcVisionRisk --> Phase2[PHASE 2: Static Validation<br/>Deterministic Backup Checks]:::processClass

    Phase2 --> StaticCheck1[VIN Format Validation<br/>regex 17 chars]:::processClass
    Phase2 --> StaticCheck2[VIN-Year Consistency<br/>decode 10th char]:::processClass
    Phase2 --> StaticCheck3[Claim Frequency<br/>threshold calc]:::processClass
    Phase2 --> StaticCheck4[Claim Velocity<br/>30-day count]:::processClass

    StaticCheck1 --> CalcStaticRisk[Calculate Static Risk Score]:::processClass
    StaticCheck2 --> CalcStaticRisk
    StaticCheck3 --> CalcStaticRisk
    StaticCheck4 --> CalcStaticRisk

    %% Combine Phase 1 & 2
    CalcStaticRisk --> CombinePhase12[Combine Vision + Static Signals]:::processClass

    CombinePhase12 --> CheckCombinedRisk{Combined Risk<br/>Score?}:::decisionClass

    %% Decision: Skip Phase 3 if clear result
    CheckCombinedRisk -->|0.8+ High Risk| SkipPhase3High[Skip Phase 3<br/>Clear High Risk]:::outputClass
    CheckCombinedRisk -->|under 0.3 Low Risk| SkipPhase3Low[Skip Phase 3<br/>Clear Low Risk]:::outputClass
    CheckCombinedRisk -->|0.3-0.8 Borderline| Phase3[PHASE 3: Behavioral Synthesis<br/>LLM Pattern Analysis]:::llmClass

    %% PHASE 3: Behavioral Analysis (only for borderline cases)
    Phase3 --> BehaviorAgent[Behavior Pattern Analyzer<br/>LLM reasoning]:::llmClass

    BehaviorAgent --> BehaviorChecks[Synthesize:<br/>- All fraud signals<br/>- Damage pattern coherence<br/>- Story consistency<br/>- Location reasonableness]:::agentClass

    %% Final Risk Calculation
    SkipPhase3High --> FinalRisk[Calculate Final Risk Score]:::processClass
    SkipPhase3Low --> FinalRisk
    BehaviorChecks --> FinalRisk

    FinalRisk --> RiskDecision{Final Risk<br/>Score?}:::decisionClass

    %% Risk Outcomes
    RiskDecision -->|0.7+| HighRisk[HIGH RISK<br/>AI detected sophisticated fraud<br/>Recommend: REJECT]:::outputClass
    RiskDecision -->|0.4-0.7| MediumRisk[MEDIUM RISK<br/>AI flagged concerns<br/>Recommend: Human Review]:::outputClass
    RiskDecision -->|under 0.4| LowRisk[LOW RISK<br/>AI verified legitimacy<br/>Recommend: APPROVE]:::outputClass

    %% Store Results
    HighRisk --> StoreResults[Store Fraud Detection Results<br/>with AI Evidence]:::dbClass
    MediumRisk --> StoreResults
    LowRisk --> StoreResults

    StoreResults --> LogUsage[Log AI Agent Performance<br/>Token Usage, Detection Quality]:::dbClass

    %% Return to Main Supervisor
    LogUsage --> ReturnResult[Return to Main Supervisor<br/>with AI Fraud Analysis]:::agentClass

    ReturnResult --> MainSupervisor{Main Supervisor<br/>Review AI Findings}:::decisionClass

    %% Final Actions
    MainSupervisor -->|High Fraud| BlockClaim[Block Auto-Approval<br/>AI detected fraud indicators]:::outputClass
    MainSupervisor -->|Medium Fraud| FlagClaim[Flag for Human Review<br/>AI recommends investigation]:::outputClass
    MainSupervisor -->|Low Fraud| ProceedClaim[Proceed with Processing<br/>AI verified claim legitimacy]:::outputClass

    %% End States
    BlockClaim --> End1([Manual Review Required<br/>AI Evidence Provided]):::outputClass
    FlagClaim --> End2([Flagged for Review<br/>AI Concerns Noted]):::outputClass
    ProceedClaim --> End3([Continue Processing<br/>AI Verification Passed]):::outputClass

    %% Highlight AI Value
    note1[AI VALUE DEMONSTRATED:<br/>Vision agents catch sophisticated fraud<br/>that static rules cannot detect]:::llmClass
    AggregateVision -.-> note1
